{"kind": "mod", "id": 1884, "name": "Continuous Healing", "slug": "continuous-healing", "teaser": "Tired of having to heal every limb one by one? Now you can heal them all in one go until done or manually cancelled!", "owner_name": "Lacyway", "downloads": 118932, "favourites": 161, "featured": false, "contains_ads": false, "contains_ai_content": false, "cheat_notice": false, "license_name": "Creative Commons BY-NC-ND 4.0", "guid": "com.lacyway.ch", "thumbnail_local": null, "category": "Scripting", "category_id": 3, "updated_at": "2026-08-08T18:02:21.000000Z", "created_at": "2024-12-12T09:18:22.000000Z", "published_at": "2024-12-12T09:18:00.000000Z", "latest_constraint": ">=4.1.0", "latest_version": "1.6.0", "has_local": false, "has_github": false, "license_link": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-nd/4.0/legalcode", "description_html": "<h3><strong>What does the mod do?</strong></h3>\n<p>With <strong>Continuous Healing</strong> you can click the healing button once and it will continue healing all limbs until you reach 100%, removing the need to do it for every limb and waiting for the animations to bring up your weapon. The delay that is normally 2 seconds is removed between each limb, speeding up healing slightly as well. If the med kit runs out it will stop as per usual. Tested and working with Fika.</p>\n<p>I <em><strong>highly recommend</strong></em> using this with <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/file/1779-healing-autocancel\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Healing Autocancel</a>!</p>\n<h3><strong>Incompatible mods</strong></h3>\n<p><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/file/260-bettermeds-revised/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Better Meds Revised</a></p>\n<h3><strong>Known issues</strong></h3>\n<p>Healing a destroyed limb with a <strong>CMS</strong> or <strong>Surv12 kit</strong> will not play the animation on the second limb due to how the animations work for these items. You will still heal them at a slightly faster rate, just wait until your weapon appears and it’s done. Looking for an elegant fix if possible down the line.</p>\n<p>If you have any issues with the mod, be thorough in your report or you will be ignored. Thanks!</p>\n<p>You can support me on Ko-Fi</p>\n<p><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://ko-fi.com/lacyway\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Click</a></p>\n", "versions": [{"version": "1.3.0", "spt_version_constraint": "~3.11.0", "content_length": null, "downloads": 28454, "published_at": "2025-03-15T19:35:33.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/1884/continuous-healing/1.3.0", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": "unknown", "dependencies": []}, {"version": "1.4.0", "spt_version_constraint": ">=4.0 <4.1.0", "content_length": 5263, "downloads": 52626, "published_at": "2025-10-11T19:30:00.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/1884/continuous-healing/1.4.0", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": "compatible", "dependencies": []}, {"version": "1.5.0", "spt_version_constraint": ">=4.0.13 <4.1.0", "content_length": 11004, "downloads": 11087, "published_at": "2026-07-08T08:37:00.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/1884/continuous-healing/1.5.0", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": "compatible", "dependencies": []}, {"version": "1.6.0", "spt_version_constraint": ">=4.1.0", "content_length": 5946, "downloads": 1497, "published_at": "2026-08-08T07:37:00.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/1884/continuous-healing/1.6.0", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": "compatible", "dependencies": []}], "repos": ["Lacyway/ContinuousHealing"], "source_code_links": [{"url": "https://github.com/Lacyway/Contin